{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "1d14676b42d6bf6393f9c8423043e820fbe1381ca43cef6540cd91357d4449c0", "ja": "超順調！　～インタールード～", "zh": "超级顺利！～插曲～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "000d7e270cb22fa93ff88e7769ed59621c4a7dfbeb3444f4d6dcdbf5b0a3eba6", "ja": "撮影の合間、海辺で遊ぶ未来とロコを見守る\nプロデューサーの元に、海美がやってくる。\n撮影や役への熱意を語っているうちに、風花\nが撮影再開を告げにくる。それぞれの想いを\n胸に、彼女たちは撮影に臨むのだった。", "zh": "在拍摄的空档，制作人看着在海边玩耍的\n未来和ROCO时，海美来到他身边，\n吐露自己对拍摄及角色的热情，\n此时风花前来告知即将继续开拍。\n众人怀抱各自的心思，前去进行拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c7a9f08f50a8ba5a5069ba2a7b3f5dd90cc21570c22d31f211e12127e5f5f2fd", "ja": "（撮影は順調に進んでいる！　次は夕方のシーンの撮影\nなので、少し長めの休憩時間になった）", "zh": "（拍摄进行得很顺利！\n下一场戏是要拍傍晚的场景，所以休息时间比较长。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "c0dfadf591e210ae11665e75284faff6610bc8faaf57721746c5f287d8904320", "ja": "あはははっ、砂に足が埋まるの、\nくすぐったいけど、気持ちいい～……♪", "zh": "哈哈哈，脚埋在沙子里痒痒的，\n但是好舒服喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "1d17e632b4b58d1accac14c3bd0bbacbde0a600fe84d0d82e4a32b7bb07a7833", "ja": "はっ！？　インスピレーションがカミングしました！\nミライ、砂のオブジェクトを作りましょう！", "zh": "啊！？Inspiration在Coming！\n未来，来做沙雕吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "44e564a7677449cac7ed039d66f6c603b2723fd905a362f8743235d5a9e2d33b", "ja": "わぁ、面白そう！　やるやる！\nなに作ろっか？　やっぱり砂のお城？", "zh": "哇，好像很好玩！我要做沙雕！\n做什么好呢？要盖沙堡吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "deba6aa0f1608bac29bdcb88ae0668344e5361c555aa18e30765c412cc931921", "ja": "超ビーチバレーをテーマにした、スカルプチャーを\n考えています。さっそくブレストしますよ！", "zh": "ROCO正在思考以超级沙滩排球为主题的Sculpture。\n立刻来一场脑力激荡吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dda2ff4dc47af742f97762ce40927d1cda9ccb881428c243f91c04338bd8d7b3", "ja": "（ロコも未来も、元気だな。\n遊び疲れてしまわないといいが……まあ、大丈夫か）", "zh": "（ROCO和未来都很有活力呢。\n希望她们不会玩到没力……算了，应该不用担心吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "a3f8363b1155698a630f9c931a60b877abb9a5f08836606606883df36094f273", "ja": "{$P$}！\nこんなところで、なにしてるの？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n你待在这种地方做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "17be0db9b274445b7d55874aae29f755cc396f166a684bdb93b51e862ec8d6d9", "ja": "ん？　海美か……。\n砂浜を見てたんだよ。誰か溺れたりしたら大変だから。", "zh": "嗯？是海美啊……\n我在看着沙滩啊，要是有人溺水就不好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "0b90a599cf3d38e0871804dce7965517de5cf0fb152f6b125cde23f83404a8b7", "ja": "そうなんだ……ねえねえっ！\n{$P$}も一緒に遊ぼうよ♪", "zh": "是喔……欸欸！\n{$P$}你也一起来玩嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3e7e767d229fe2e647ca500c293bfeff913ea9cd43446a82256211a1c78d2db2", "ja": "え？　いや、水着持ってきてないし……。", "zh": "咦？不用啦，而且我也没有带泳装来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "0e06a2cb3b4b7999dd65ffdcb8e69f29f6eb66608a21802102effe2b0e0e6b5a", "ja": "大丈夫、私、自分の持ってきたんだ！\n貸してあげるよっ☆　あ、やっぱりイヤかな？！", "zh": "没关系，我有带我自己的来！我可以借给你☆\n啊，你会排斥穿别人的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3f06c2080ed020b115f8f34af0a2673d6bcf6050ba862d0a259e9642d517cb38", "ja": "そ、そうだな、やめておくよ。\nイヤとかじゃなくて、みんなビックリするだろうし。", "zh": "算、算是吧，我不用啦。\n也不是排斥啦，我只是觉得会吓到大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "77055a7058cf3eaaa318142f46811901436d618a9430182f507c396ede93ca38", "ja": "そっか、残念。でも{$P$}、\nホントに見てるだけで大丈夫？", "zh": "是喔，好可惜。但是{$P$}，\n你真的光是看着就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "abfcf169ec338b7f0045bb3eeb4d39ffb570571049119f237c77b82eba0df470", "ja": "ああ、意外と楽しいよ。\nみんな楽しそうだし、レジャー気分も味わえるし。", "zh": "嗯，比你想像中更好玩喔。\n大家看起来这么开心，我也能体验出来玩的感觉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "aed8dfb1645a85af6ac5fa63f1912a841c12e8e6b6c70c4ab3401a73ba8ed4d0", "ja": "そうなの？　じゃあ私も見てみよ！\n{$P$}の隣、おジャマするねっ♪", "zh": "是吗？那我也来看看好了！\n我要坐在{$P$}的旁边♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8aa4f454f6517a6b9d165b1e6ce39d6786bb6765d3f069ea3d7c99702dd0d617", "ja": "ん？　あ、ああ……。", "zh": "嗯？好、好喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "5736d56fdc809922beb424b44be17de67415f3b5ffd9f2790180ad405584d165", "ja": "ディスアグリーメントです！\n中央にはキング、そこは譲れません！", "zh": "Disagreement！\n中间要放王者，这点不能退让！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "0808414268aa397df76ff36332121779d2fa498cd54d94186230fd304b6fef26", "ja": "え～っ、だってだって、主役は海美さんなんだから、\nやっぱり真ん中は海美さんじゃない？", "zh": "咦～可是可是，主角是海美啊，\n正中间应该要是海美吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "89b994717ebc0ff86bee38b43d68ca4166013963cd6bd411685db4539669c13f", "ja": "主役とかじゃないの！　一番ビューティフルで\nパワフルなキングが、ぴったりなんですよ！", "zh": "不是主角的问题！\n最Beautiful又Powerful的王者，是最适合的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d8067cf71546f747566f77bb9b9bfc84a413e326c8b6b9182f817786afa08a9", "ja": "え～、でもでも……！", "zh": "咦～可是可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "57e6ee572d1ebe9d1952ad4b949fc943aafaa6c4ea871ee275d66ca5ab71000a", "ja": "あはははっ！　みらいっちとロコロコ、\nなんか言い合ってるね～！　すっごく楽しそう！", "zh": "哈哈哈！小未未和ROCOROCO，\n好像在吵些什么呢～！感觉好开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1ebdbb71a7c2e2fa690a325e68785ab1727aa088513910188d81e53fc55e88dd", "ja": "そうだな……。\n撮影も楽しんでくれてるみたいだし、なによりだよ。", "zh": "是啊……\n她们好像也很享受拍摄电影的过程，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "725228c8850e9b78235e9a7c45b1e96364624903c1d7e409efab45dd49dcb046", "ja": "うんうんっ！　楽しいのが、一番だよねっ☆", "zh": "嗯嗯！开心是最棒的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_1024", "source_sha256": "811467a20f6e5ad601e53fb230aff32667ae2acf7e6adda519c396ee3ef3c739", "ja": "海美は？", "zh": "海美你呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "204dc1d1978ca74ffbd51ca38a38332d878c77ad1c9882edaadef8c89e10edd8", "ja": "それで、海美はどうだ？　楽しめてるか？", "zh": "那海美你呢？你有乐在其中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "83a0c224d0bc2de1a1928fb01cd4b03d36e376b0fc72891d422e23f614d8714b", "ja": "えっ……私？　もちろん、楽しんでるよっ。\n撮影の間、ずっと落ち着かないくらい！", "zh": "咦……我吗？我当然很乐在其中啊！\n拍摄时我甚至一直坐不住！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2002_029umi", "source_sha256": "d566d6f4e1af39706108d2f1d41105c5c095b207471611f309615b22290c5a0d", "ja": "だって、映画にも出られるでしょ？　それに、\n劇場のステージにも出られるし……とっても幸せ！", "zh": "可以在电影里登场，这不是很棒吗？\n而且在剧场表演时也能出场……我超幸福的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2003_p", "source_sha256": "05def3304e48a3cba84ccb51f55a4e33238f1218bad76a35a20d936c0a6972b0", "ja": "そうか……なら、いいんだけどな。", "zh": "是吗……那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2004_029umi", "source_sha256": "f4726381b34c9906285d1fcc8d3f5d3740d45550be72e3a5a0e5088c9d05a7b2", "ja": "あ……もしかして{$P$}、\n心配してくれた？　私っぽくない役だから？", "zh": "啊……该不会{$P$}，\n你是在担心我吗？因为我是演和我不像的角色？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2005_p", "source_sha256": "d977f704af27c2c81f43b365630f46f9738e3553790e5f7b444d13a28a1cf4e1", "ja": "まあ……そうだな、少しだけ。\n演技は完ぺきだけど、楽しめてるのかなって……。", "zh": "哎……对啊，是有一点啦。\n虽然你的演技很完美，我还是担心你能不能演得开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2006_029umi", "source_sha256": "60f38a4428c23384ae2e19b6301a5441b6f212a3bff807e9e2fb08b83383ee92", "ja": "えへへっ、心配してくれてありがと☆\nでも大丈夫！　すっごく楽しいから！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你替我担心☆\n不过没问题的！我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2007_029umi", "source_sha256": "fe30fec6ca0966b6c1fd76ab91699905c43602605c6ca4de433ddbbd5964cabf", "ja": "この映画を見たら、きっとみんな元気になってくれる\nでしょ？　そう考えると、私、ワクワクするの♪", "zh": "看了这部电影，大家一定会充满活力吧？\n我一这么想，就觉得好兴奋♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2008_029umi", "source_sha256": "6e327354a1b1c4251b291895263c6215e2b0c3bc934c6506cc9a575650e33f04", "ja": "それにね……映画の中の私って、\n結構、本当の私と近いところもあったりするし。", "zh": "而且啊……其实电影里的我，\n和现实中的我也有很相似的部分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2009_p", "source_sha256": "335e9dccb143206ed4d3282151d11281eabcf8d43012f5abd17948fd1b9365c3", "ja": "ああ、お姉さんにケガさせちゃったんだっけ。", "zh": "嗯，你说过你曾经让姊姊受伤对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2010_029umi", "source_sha256": "d6f45148b27ed00d4daf600e51bc09a0c6639cba50c898acac0e65ade34d68a3", "ja": "うん、それ以外にも。私って小さい頃、お姉ちゃんと\n一緒のステージに立ちたいって、ずっと思ってたの。", "zh": "对啊，除此之外还有别的。\n我从小就一直很想站上和姊姊一样的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "5c2ea9497b1a1d6a66b57a019ab6b75df0a5f7222e6b3aa60469849ae8116a42", "ja": "映画の中の私もね、クライマックスでさよちんと同じ\nコートに立てて、うれしくなるの。そういうのとかっ！", "zh": "电影里的我也是，在故事高潮和纱纱站上同一个球场时，\n就觉得好开心。这些部分就跟我很像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2012_p", "source_sha256": "d59fbc7ced8d3568656d6b4084adb7b9e35adf9ea0ec5353c9330a05fbed2e1c", "ja": "なるほど……思いがけず、ピッタリの役だったんだな。\nそれなら安心したよ。", "zh": "原来如此……这个角色出乎意料地很适合你呢。\n既然是这样，那我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2013_029umi", "source_sha256": "7f9b42c668b39e5c02183abfdc13646c4112908deabfcd0662f966d5cd012efd", "ja": "うんうんっ！\nこんなに大切な役をくれて、本当にありがとう！", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n真的很谢谢你为我争取到这么重要的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2014_029umi", "source_sha256": "b9467250dd529a6010e4efd34877169d4b1d0669c2b0931e06cdf6836a34f79d", "ja": "私、最後までちゃんと上手に出来るように頑張るから！\n見ててねっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "我会努力好好表现到最后的！\n你要看好喔，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2015_p", "source_sha256": "c1a7749e5ab1fbed9d9559246ac6af03e2f099582e2b6c209401e11e269ac003", "ja": "もちろん。海美の演技、楽しみにしてるぞ！", "zh": "那当然，我很期待海美的演技喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2016_029umi", "source_sha256": "8a9a7e295242d4cdede717546024f25f031694cd86e97daa1a70d0e2e2504691", "ja": "うん……って、なんか昔話しちゃった！\nこういうの、役にひっぱられるっていうのかな？", "zh": "嗯……不对，我怎么讲起往事了！\n这种情况，就是被角色影响了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2017_029umi", "source_sha256": "3420675362edb08bb7f1bd39cb26d177edc17f02051793aefaa0f623f2db5351", "ja": "あははっ☆　ちょっと……照れちゃうねっ！", "zh": "哈哈☆感觉……有点害羞呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2018_p", "source_sha256": "d18f3f1d4385d7f142ddf1ca9b15202298618d8c5f42613b774b8a0eb4a4bf51", "ja": "はは、海美は、昔の話をすると照れるのか。\nなんて言うか……人それぞれだな。", "zh": "哈哈，海美你说起往事就会害羞吗？\n该怎么说呢……每个人都不同呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e8359a595be3bc4a20de3513930d01e578746873e6934e96c63ec56c1aee15ad", "ja": "あ、海美ちゃん、{$P$}さんも。\nここにいたんですね。", "zh": "啊，海美，还有{$P$}。\n原来你们在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2020_p", "source_sha256": "adee969830e421e0dac1bfd38e42ecff2e17eba8d33277e2bc977cde748ab48f", "ja": "っと……風花、どうした？", "zh": "啊……风花，有事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9fd5e06cbf326f04913ed84d63851a093b2c5e6358fec6ea8a81c702be754209", "ja": "スタッフさんが撮影の準備を始めているので、\nそろそろかと思って、呼びに来たんです。", "zh": "工作人员在开始准备拍摄了。\n我想说时间差不多了，就来叫你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2022_p", "source_sha256": "fbc39f701503fe8b025bd1a6fb9f3d55cf49b9b0edf4b1f002c742dff542f807", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nそうだな、そろそろ戻っておくか。", "zh": "哦哦，谢谢你。\n也对，差不多该回去了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2023_029umi", "source_sha256": "aaf79f28f8fb4f3f9133f4109db431c1b139c3aa5265b92c5b6b075f214392b4", "ja": "あっ、じゃあ私、みらいっちたちを呼んでくるねっ！\nお～い、みらいっち、ロコロコー！", "zh": "啊，那我去叫小未未她们！\n喂～小未未，ROCOROCO～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a6d88ba6b7941e7b2b63a0d9ad6fdc1544c07a3d1ade66de54e160c967f17e8a", "ja": "ふふっ……海美ちゃん、元気いっぱいですね♪\n本当に、映画の中とは別人みたい……。", "zh": "呵呵……海美真有活力呢♪\n真的和电影里截然不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2025_p", "source_sha256": "2958ff58336b4fc3dceacada56d8172dd74b861093ad54f0e83d33cc9bb54f74", "ja": "はは、風花もキング役、頑張れてるじゃないか。", "zh": "哈哈，风花不是也很努力演出王者吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "501fa90decd641185111bd0e68e56175eaea74835df2a5791001e0214d16bcf4", "ja": "はい。でも、それも海美ちゃんと、\n{$P$}さんのおかげです。", "zh": "是啊，不过这也是多亏有海美和\n{$P$}先生啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6fb910c3eea5bc7e42c8bb396279a9efaed5da5d8499f4436ec887829b0abe0d", "ja": "私、頑張りますね。\n海美ちゃんにも……誰にも、負けないくらい！", "zh": "我会拚命努力的，\n不输给海美……也不输给任何人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2028_p", "source_sha256": "3b1477d3b9b9e0a6f7594a2eccfa6eb2cb9053fc8d592cb0680cdc45733b8f7e", "ja": "（それぞれの悩みと向き合いながら、\n銀幕の中のアイドルたちは、輝きを増していく）", "zh": "（每个人都面对着自己的烦恼，\n而大银幕中的偶像们，变得越来越耀眼。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0050_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_05_2029_p", "source_sha256": "94bcbda3b47dd07173db8d6b71a870980b4ca96179c1e31b83718977b045e716", "ja": "（これから撮影するクライマックスはきっと、\nすごいものになるだろう……そんな予感がするぞ！）", "zh": "（接下来就要拍摄故事高潮了，\n一定能拍出不得了的成果吧……我有这样的预感！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
